OL,3,GNEWSAHS2 bridge lifts completed during
OL,4,Amotorway closure
OL,5,
OL,6,FHS2 engineers have successfully
OL,7,Finstalled the final two of six large
OL,8,Fbridge sections that will carry the
OL,9,Fhigh-speed railway over the M42.
OL,11,FThe two viaduct spans were lifted into
OL,12,Fplace at the Water Orton site, in
OL,13,FWarwickshire, during the weekend
OL,14,Fclosure of the motorway, with the works
OL,15,Fcompleted in the early hours, HS2 Ltd
OL,16,Fsaid.
OL,18,FThe viaducts form the top of the
OL,19,Ftriangular "delta junction" for the
OL,20,Fhigh speed railway, linking Birmingham
OL,21,Fwith the main line heading north.
OL,23,APub: 21-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
